internal/db/sqlcgen/auth_projects.sql.go | const listCurrentUserProjects | sql:admin | 1 | project | Generated from auth_projects.sql ListCurrentUserProjects.
internal/infra/db/chatauthority/access.go | func Load | sql:admin | 1 | project | A project admin (project role admin or super_admin) has the admin scope of chat in the project.
internal/infra/db/chatauthority/access.go | func Load | sql:super_admin | 1 | project | As above.
